1
00:00:01,181 --> 00:00:09,221
The Princess Sapphire
Knight of the Ribbon

2
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:50,160
♪ Atashi no miru yume himitsu nano ♪
The dreams I see are my secret

3
00:00:51,250 --> 00:00:57,089
♪ Dare ni mo iwanai himitsu nano ♪
I won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret

4
00:00:58,541 --> 00:01:02,461
♪ Akai manto hira hira ♪
A red cape fluttering

5
00:01:02,462 --> 00:01:04,981
♪ Uma o tobasu oujo ♪
Galloping on a horse—the princess

6
00:01:04,981 --> 00:01:06,901
♪ Sore ga atashi ♪
That’s me!

7
00:01:07,621 --> 00:01:10,901
♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪
-

8
00:01:10,905 --> 00:01:13,424
♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪
-

9
00:01:14,541 --> 00:01:18,021
♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪
-

10
00:01:18,140 --> 00:01:20,741
♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪
-

11
00:01:21,500 --> 00:01:25,220
♪ Ribon no kishi wa ♪
The Knight of the Ribbon,

12
00:01:25,220 --> 00:01:28,621
♪ Honto wa hontto wa ♪
Truly, truly,

13
00:01:28,622 --> 00:01:31,822
♪ Atashi nano sa ♪
It’s really me!

14
00:01:44,101 --> 00:01:50,141
First Episode
The Princess Knight
The Prince & the Angel

15
00:02:27,220 --> 00:02:33,240
Um, is there a kid around here with blue eyes who looks like a boy or a girl?

16
00:02:33,424 --> 00:02:34,600
Nope, no weirdos like that around.

17
00:02:36,720 --> 00:02:37,600
Waa!

18
00:02:37,740 --> 00:02:38,660
Help!

19
00:02:38,670 --> 00:02:40,260
Pick me up!

20
00:02:41,220 --> 00:02:46,400
Kanabun-chan, isn't there a girl in this town with black hair who looks like a boy?

21
00:02:46,401 --> 00:02:49,620
Beats me, I've never seen one. Well, see ya!

22
00:02:50,870 --> 00:02:51,870
What a letdown...

23
00:02:52,475 --> 00:02:55,340
I've been searching for 12 years already...

24
00:03:04,510 --> 00:03:05,720
Why are you attacking me?!

25
00:03:05,980 --> 00:03:08,540
Well, they just wanted to know if you're a guy or a girl.

26
00:03:09,200 --> 00:03:10,200
Who hired you?!

27
00:03:10,400 --> 00:03:15,689
If this water touches you, men will turn blue and women will turn purple!

28
00:03:16,213 --> 00:03:20,060
That's for sure!

29
00:03:21,140 --> 00:03:21,720
They ran away!

30
00:03:21,920 --> 00:03:22,160
Get 'em!

31
00:03:22,360 --> 00:03:22,520
Hey!

32
00:03:23,089 --> 00:03:24,514
Up we go!

33
00:03:24,538 --> 00:03:25,428
Giddyup!

34
00:03:25,877 --> 00:03:28,840
Come on, once we start, get off your rear!

35
00:03:29,080 --> 00:03:30,360
You complete idiot!

36
00:03:30,863 --> 00:03:31,580
Get up!

37
00:03:38,020 --> 00:03:39,020
Ah!

38
00:03:45,620 --> 00:03:46,620
Oh!

39
00:03:52,070 --> 00:03:53,070
Hey, partner!

40
00:03:58,780 --> 00:04:01,480
Which one should I pick... Ah, this one!

41
00:04:05,660 --> 00:04:06,660
Tell your boss!

42
00:04:06,815 --> 00:04:08,560
No matter how much you chase after me, it's useless!

43
00:04:38,298 --> 00:04:42,421
Your Highness, wake up. It is time to awaken. Whoa!

44
00:04:47,660 --> 00:04:48,700
Good morning, Garigori!

45
00:04:48,800 --> 00:04:50,020
What a waste of time!

46
00:04:50,080 --> 00:04:51,540
That's a waste of 30 seconds!

47
00:04:51,700 --> 00:04:53,820
I woke up well before the time!

48
00:04:54,795 --> 00:04:57,400
I say, please stop both of these useless antics!

49
00:04:58,710 --> 00:05:00,880
Your clothes are ready.

50
00:05:06,280 --> 00:05:08,480
Come, Your Highness, please change into these.

51
00:05:11,060 --> 00:05:15,220
What are you holding? I'm not the one wearing it!

52
00:05:15,985 --> 00:05:18,040
Your Highness—!

53
00:05:25,320 --> 00:05:26,320
Hey!

54
00:05:26,380 --> 00:05:27,541
Good morning, Opal!

55
00:05:29,230 --> 00:05:30,260
Get my clothes out.

56
00:05:34,620 --> 00:05:35,620
This is good!

57
00:05:35,725 --> 00:05:39,440
This is way better than these flashy, glittery clothes!

58
00:05:39,735 --> 00:05:40,880
See you later, Opal!

59
00:05:45,560 --> 00:05:46,380
Strike!

60
00:05:46,465 --> 00:05:47,465
Thank you!

61
00:06:02,790 --> 00:06:04,005
Dedicated to the everlasting prosperity

62
00:06:04,029 --> 00:06:05,560
of His Majesty,

63
00:06:05,584 --> 00:06:10,841
Her Majesty the Queen, and the royal family for thousands of generations,

64
00:06:10,865 --> 00:06:13,600
we sincerely pray for your ever-flourishing welcome...

65
00:06:16,230 --> 00:06:17,380
It's the Prince!

66
00:06:17,475 --> 00:06:18,660
It's Prince Sapphire!

67
00:06:18,661 --> 00:06:19,420
Not again!

68
00:06:19,650 --> 00:06:22,928
Announcing the arrival of Grand Duke Duralumin!

69
00:06:26,050 --> 00:06:29,786
I am deeply honored to behold your gracious presence.

70
00:06:29,810 --> 00:06:31,315
It is wonderful to see you in good health as well...

71
00:06:31,340 --> 00:06:32,981
What an over-the-top greeting!

72
00:06:34,360 --> 00:06:36,929
Now then, Your Majesty, regarding the usual deer hunt tournament,

73
00:06:36,953 --> 00:06:39,452
this year we plan to make it even grander and more extravagant...

74
00:06:39,476 --> 00:06:41,680
Do we even have the money for that?

75
00:06:42,065 --> 00:06:45,560
No need to worry, we'll squeeze plenty of taxes out of the people.

76
00:06:47,870 --> 00:06:49,104
Bring the seal!

77
00:06:50,070 --> 00:06:51,140
Press it yourself!

78
00:07:00,860 --> 00:07:02,420
I'll take the army afterwards.

79
00:07:02,600 --> 00:07:04,900
Excuse me... Good morning, Father!

80
00:07:06,780 --> 00:07:07,780
Sapphire!

81
00:07:07,890 --> 00:07:09,740
Take off your hat indoors!

82
00:07:11,140 --> 00:07:12,360
What is with that outfit?

83
00:07:12,555 --> 00:07:14,160
Don't you feel any shame?

84
00:07:15,760 --> 00:07:19,674
But I feel so much more comfortable in these clothes...

85
00:07:20,735 --> 00:07:22,740
Sapphire, you are the prince of this country.

86
00:07:22,890 --> 00:07:25,100
A prince must show more dignity!

87
00:07:25,465 --> 00:07:26,680
That's hardly normal!

88
00:07:27,430 --> 00:07:28,640
There's a limit to your carelessness!

89
00:07:29,320 --> 00:07:30,640
Then what am I supposed to say?

90
00:07:31,265 --> 00:07:33,040
Good morning, honorable Father!

91
00:07:33,960 --> 00:07:34,980
What's so funny...

92
00:07:38,100 --> 00:07:39,455
Grand Duke Duralumin!

93
00:07:39,840 --> 00:07:41,360
Ah, Lord Nylon.

94
00:07:41,705 --> 00:07:44,760
That bratty prince, what a damn nuisance he is.

95
00:07:45,030 --> 00:07:46,853
He intentionally tried to get in the way of me stamping the seal...

96
00:07:46,877 --> 00:07:48,600
Now, now, Duke.

97
00:07:48,905 --> 00:07:51,478
Prince Sapphire won't be able to act so high and mighty for much longer.

98
00:07:51,502 --> 00:07:54,747
Once it is revealed that the prince is actually a woman, the throne cannot be inherited.

99
00:07:55,015 --> 00:07:58,095
After all, by the laws of this kingdom, only a man can ascend to the throne.

100
00:07:58,120 --> 00:08:00,520
Once the secret is exposed, this country will belong to the Grand Duke.

101
00:08:00,545 --> 00:08:04,000
That prince is quite a handful. Don't lower your guard!

102
00:08:04,480 --> 00:08:07,660
Rule 1: The king must not yawn in front of the people.

103
00:08:07,900 --> 00:08:09,760
Hiccups and burps are completely out of the question.

104
00:08:10,050 --> 00:08:12,880
Rule: The king must rarely laugh in front of the people.

105
00:08:13,180 --> 00:08:15,440
Rule: The king must not fetch things himself.

106
00:08:15,610 --> 00:08:17,200
He should have his retainers fetch them.

107
00:08:17,305 --> 00:08:18,305
Your Highness!

108
00:08:19,070 --> 00:08:22,300
Reading mangas again, I see. That simply won't do.

109
00:08:22,840 --> 00:08:27,293
When I was about Your Highness's age, I read much, much better books.

110
00:08:27,317 --> 00:08:28,481
About this much?

111
00:08:28,540 --> 00:08:29,540
Even more than that.

112
00:08:29,965 --> 00:08:31,480
Even more... Your Highness, please help me!

113
00:08:31,580 --> 00:08:32,039
Your Highness!

114
00:08:32,220 --> 00:08:33,220
Your Highness!

115
00:08:33,320 --> 00:08:34,559
Please help me!

116
00:08:46,050 --> 00:08:47,320
Ah, look what happened.

117
00:08:47,595 --> 00:08:50,200
Sapphire, where are you going in the middle of your studies?

118
00:08:51,100 --> 00:08:52,740
Now, return to your room.

119
00:08:53,080 --> 00:08:54,220
I hate studying!

120
00:08:54,749 --> 00:08:56,512
The castle is full of nothing but old people. I feel like I'm suffocating.

121
00:08:56,536 --> 00:08:59,020
Sapphire, what on earth are you saying?

122
00:08:59,639 --> 00:09:01,015
I'm heading outside.

123
00:09:01,039 --> 00:09:01,474
Sapphire!

124
00:09:02,829 --> 00:09:04,820
Sapphire, poor child.

125
00:09:05,565 --> 00:09:09,140
The fact that she grew up like that is all because of the laws of this kingdom.

126
00:09:09,545 --> 00:09:13,200
When that child was born, it was right around the time these flowers were blooming.

127
00:09:23,540 --> 00:09:27,880
Hooray!

128
00:09:34,739 --> 00:09:36,520
People of the kingdom, rejoice!

129
00:09:36,745 --> 00:09:37,880
An heir has been born!

130
00:09:38,170 --> 00:09:39,620
A prince has been born!

131
00:09:43,136 --> 00:09:44,600
I am deceiving my people.

132
00:09:45,025 --> 00:09:48,800
Even though a princess was born, I declared her to be a prince.

133
00:09:49,579 --> 00:09:54,260
But Your Majesty, under the laws of our country, a princess cannot ascend to the throne.

134
00:09:54,639 --> 00:09:56,960
Therefore, we had to present her as a prince.

135
00:09:57,180 --> 00:09:58,180
I know.

136
00:10:03,159 --> 00:10:05,960
You announced her as a boy even though she is a girl?

137
00:10:07,339 --> 00:10:08,660
It couldn't be helped.

138
00:10:09,079 --> 00:10:11,980
If it were discovered that she is a princess, it would be disastrous.

139
00:10:12,360 --> 00:10:16,609
That treacherous Grand Duke Duralumin would seize the opportunity to take over the kingdom.

140
00:10:16,633 --> 00:10:21,360
Your Majesty, Grand Duke Duralumin has arrived.

141
00:10:21,695 --> 00:10:23,260
He is right on time.

142
00:10:23,460 --> 00:10:25,660
Oh dear, oh dear, what shall we do? The preparations...

143
00:10:26,820 --> 00:10:29,160
The time was set, wasn't it? Hurry, the time!

144
00:10:29,495 --> 00:10:31,040
Whatever should we do?

145
00:10:32,569 --> 00:10:35,400
Put out some boys' toys—that way we can deceive him.

146
00:10:36,060 --> 00:10:38,300
Here comes the Prince!

147
00:10:53,049 --> 00:10:56,420
May you grow up healthy and strong.

148
00:10:58,979 --> 00:11:01,953
That was how they managed to fool the Grand Duke,

149
00:11:01,977 --> 00:11:05,680
but ever since then, Sapphire was raised as a boy.

150
00:11:06,365 --> 00:11:10,500
The only ones who knew the secret were the Doctor, the Nanny, and the Chamberlain.

151
00:11:14,899 --> 00:11:16,380
Twelve years have passed since then.

152
00:11:19,299 --> 00:11:21,160
The secret was strictly kept.

153
00:11:22,909 --> 00:11:25,087
But in order to protect that secret,

154
00:11:25,111 --> 00:11:28,620
Sapphire always had to be raised as a boy.

155
00:11:40,789 --> 00:11:45,480
By now, Sapphire has become completely a boy, body and soul.

156
00:11:46,200 --> 00:11:49,048
Without ever knowing the joys or happiness of being a girl,

157
00:11:49,072 --> 00:11:51,560
all for the law of the land.

158
00:11:51,584 --> 00:11:52,880
Poor Sapphire.

159
00:11:53,530 --> 00:11:55,995
Ah, I feel like I'm going mad.

160
00:12:21,949 --> 00:12:25,000
Well, well, taking a walk all by yourself, my Prince?

161
00:12:25,280 --> 00:12:25,760
Lord Nylon!

162
00:12:26,160 --> 00:12:27,240
I hate you!

163
00:12:27,295 --> 00:12:28,295
Go away!

164
00:12:29,519 --> 00:12:31,235
What a cold response.

165
00:12:31,259 --> 00:12:34,660
Actually, I was hoping Your Highness might give me a lesson in swordsmanship.

166
00:12:34,940 --> 00:12:35,940
All right!

167
00:12:36,125 --> 00:12:37,240
I am deeply honored!

168
00:12:37,870 --> 00:12:39,180
Come at me with all you've got!

169
00:12:53,605 --> 00:12:55,436
How's that?!

170
00:12:57,092 --> 00:12:58,760
Nylon, what's next?

171
00:13:02,295 --> 00:13:05,619
If I may, excuse me, but the fruit from that tree...

172
00:13:08,765 --> 00:13:09,980
Like this!

173
00:13:13,360 --> 00:13:14,560
What's next?

174
00:13:14,855 --> 00:13:19,580
As for embroidery practice, whoever finishes this beautiful, beautiful embroidery first wins.

175
00:13:19,840 --> 00:13:20,840
How annoying!

176
00:13:21,050 --> 00:13:24,336
How could a prince like me do an imitation of a girl like that?!

177
00:13:24,685 --> 00:13:28,680
Lord Nylon, you were the one who sent an assassin after me the other day, weren't you!

178
00:13:29,270 --> 00:13:31,520
I know nothing of such a— Speak!

179
00:13:31,960 --> 00:13:33,460
Don't you ever lay a hand on me again!

180
00:13:41,779 --> 00:13:42,779
Hello!

181
00:13:43,320 --> 00:13:44,320
Who is that?

182
00:13:46,680 --> 00:13:47,680
Who are you?

183
00:13:48,779 --> 00:13:49,779
I'm Tink!

184
00:13:50,380 --> 00:13:51,380
Tink?

185
00:13:51,440 --> 00:13:52,480
What a strange name!

186
00:13:53,175 --> 00:13:55,520
I've been searching for you for 12 years.

187
00:13:55,905 --> 00:13:57,080
You are a woman!

188
00:14:01,899 --> 00:14:03,720
You are a girl!

189
00:14:04,519 --> 00:14:05,760
I'm not a girl!

190
00:14:06,250 --> 00:14:07,250
You are a girl!

191
00:14:07,900 --> 00:14:09,500
I am NOT a girl!

192
00:14:09,660 --> 00:14:10,660
Girl!

193
00:14:12,559 --> 00:14:13,559
How do you know?

194
00:14:13,980 --> 00:14:15,700
How do I know...

195
00:14:15,800 --> 00:14:17,360
I was an angel.

196
00:14:17,500 --> 00:14:17,980
An angel?

197
00:14:18,380 --> 00:14:20,460
Yeah, a former angel.

198
00:14:21,100 --> 00:14:24,020
I came down from heaven, looking for you.

199
00:14:24,700 --> 00:14:29,643
I was sent from heaven to change you back into the gentle girl you used to be.

200
00:14:29,668 --> 00:14:31,821
Make ME into a girly girl?!

201
00:14:40,499 --> 00:14:41,620
Just try it!

202
00:14:41,940 --> 00:14:45,939
I will never become anything like that!

203
00:14:46,189 --> 00:14:48,126
I'm sure a gentle girl...

204
00:14:48,150 --> 00:14:48,961
Go Away!

205
00:14:51,219 --> 00:14:53,200
I'll see you again soon.

206
00:14:54,150 --> 00:14:55,260
That's a promise!

207
00:15:02,825 --> 00:15:04,096
You cowards!

208
00:15:04,340 --> 00:15:08,140
And you still dare call yourselves top-tier hitmen employed by Lord Nylon?!

209
00:15:08,385 --> 00:15:10,667
Getting thrown into the river by a little brat like that!

210
00:15:10,860 --> 00:15:13,464
Didn't you get tossed in too, Lord Nylon?

211
00:15:13,489 --> 00:15:14,501
IDIOTS!

212
00:15:14,819 --> 00:15:17,367
After going to all the trouble of buying that potion to tell men and women apart...

213
00:15:17,391 --> 00:15:20,435
from Ponk of the Potion Cave and lacing your sword with it, you didn't even use it?!

214
00:15:20,460 --> 00:15:22,920
Um, I tried it, but...

215
00:15:24,535 --> 00:15:25,535
It worked!

216
00:15:25,640 --> 00:15:26,640
It worked!

217
00:15:27,080 --> 00:15:27,940
It turned blue!

218
00:15:28,040 --> 00:15:28,720
It turned blue!

219
00:15:28,820 --> 00:15:30,920
Lord Nylon is a man after all!

220
00:15:31,700 --> 00:15:32,700
You fool!

221
00:15:33,130 --> 00:15:35,700
Lord Nylon, it's Ponko the apothecary.

222
00:15:37,818 --> 00:15:39,320
Ah, apothecary, I've been waiting for you.

223
00:15:39,670 --> 00:15:41,420
By the way, is that medicine ready?

224
00:15:41,480 --> 00:15:42,495
Yes.

225
00:15:43,729 --> 00:15:46,840
If someone drinks this, will they blab out the secrets of their heart over and over again?!

226
00:15:47,320 --> 00:15:48,320
Hey!

227
00:15:48,810 --> 00:15:51,040
If you fail this time, it's off with your heads!

228
00:15:52,159 --> 00:15:53,180
We'll do it properly.

229
00:15:53,520 --> 00:15:53,880
I'm sorry.

230
00:15:54,289 --> 00:15:56,200
The three of you, lure the prince out!

231
00:15:56,260 --> 00:15:57,300
Lure him out?

232
00:15:57,800 --> 00:15:58,255
That's right!

233
00:15:58,280 --> 00:15:59,480
To the Pathless Forest!

234
00:15:59,880 --> 00:16:01,400
Entice him into the Pathless Forest!

235
00:16:01,695 --> 00:16:03,540
There are man-eating wolves in there!

236
00:16:03,940 --> 00:16:07,180
If we lure Sapphire over there, he certainly won't come back in one piece!

237
00:16:07,520 --> 00:16:10,178
And even if he does come back, before that happens,

238
00:16:10,202 --> 00:16:13,120
I'll set this potion out and make him drink it first!

239
00:16:26,800 --> 00:16:27,140
Hey!

240
00:16:27,449 --> 00:16:28,449
Why are you telling that idiot?!

241
00:16:28,520 --> 00:16:29,520
I know that!

242
00:16:30,440 --> 00:16:32,160
Um, is it that way?

243
00:16:32,185 --> 00:16:32,860
Or this way?

244
00:16:32,885 --> 00:16:34,180
Oh, neat!

245
00:16:36,624 --> 00:16:37,624
Clumsy fool!

246
00:16:37,880 --> 00:16:39,169
Where did they hide?

247
00:16:41,939 --> 00:16:44,070
I've wandered into quite a dangerous place...

248
00:16:48,280 --> 00:16:49,280
What happened?

249
00:16:49,809 --> 00:16:51,560
It is I, Duralumin.

250
00:16:52,135 --> 00:16:54,360
Oh, Grand Duke, do you need something?

251
00:16:54,460 --> 00:16:57,988
Actually, I have obtained a rare foreign liquor;

252
00:16:58,012 --> 00:17:00,620
it's a very sweet wine meant for highborn ladies.

253
00:17:00,645 --> 00:17:01,740
Well, thank you for that.

254
00:17:02,145 --> 00:17:04,980
Lord Nylon, perform the poison tasting.

255
00:17:05,144 --> 00:17:06,300
Um, me?

256
00:17:06,419 --> 00:17:07,980
Um, I'm the one who has to drink it?

257
00:17:08,004 --> 00:17:09,447
That's right, gulp it down.

258
00:17:09,479 --> 00:17:11,412
All right, I'll drink it, I'm drinking it...

259
00:17:15,189 --> 00:17:18,400
My Queen here have a drink.

260
00:17:20,759 --> 00:17:23,000
How do i get out of this forest?

261
00:17:25,299 --> 00:17:28,060
Are you lost, young one?

262
00:17:28,444 --> 00:17:29,860
Old lady, please help me.

263
00:17:30,159 --> 00:17:31,420
How can I get out of here?

264
00:17:31,589 --> 00:17:33,534
Watch out for the man-eating wolf.

265
00:17:33,558 --> 00:17:37,060
It's a huge, magical wolf that's been alive for a hundred years.

266
00:17:37,359 --> 00:17:39,105
There is only one way to protect yourself from that wolf.

267
00:17:39,129 --> 00:17:41,900
There is a house up ahead.

268
00:17:41,925 --> 00:17:43,260
Go there quickly.

269
00:17:43,954 --> 00:17:45,260
Thank you, old lady.

270
00:18:14,499 --> 00:18:18,380
Soon, the drug mixed into that sake will take effect.

271
00:18:18,584 --> 00:18:20,601
Her Ladyship will start babbling away—

272
00:18:20,625 --> 00:18:23,640
Prince Sapphire is a girl, she's a girl!

273
00:18:23,859 --> 00:18:26,160
You'll start babbling too, you know.

274
00:18:26,185 --> 00:18:28,180
Because you drank that sake as well.

275
00:18:44,609 --> 00:18:45,780
It's so dusty in here.

276
00:18:48,009 --> 00:18:49,360
Ah, wolf footprints!

277
00:18:49,784 --> 00:18:51,120
They're huge.

278
00:19:01,969 --> 00:19:03,180
It's Tink?!

279
00:19:03,600 --> 00:19:04,197
Don't scare me.

280
00:19:04,221 --> 00:19:05,360
I am sorry.

281
00:19:05,864 --> 00:19:07,720
But you were tricked.

282
00:19:08,354 --> 00:19:09,680
This is the wolf's house.

283
00:19:10,340 --> 00:19:11,340
That's ridiculous.

284
00:19:11,979 --> 00:19:16,080
They say that wolf lures all travelers into this house and eats them.

285
00:19:17,039 --> 00:19:20,540
Look, those are all hats from the people who got eaten.

286
00:19:21,009 --> 00:19:22,120
How can we possibly beat it?

287
00:19:23,839 --> 00:19:26,940
Well, they say wolves have a soft spot for girls.

288
00:19:27,974 --> 00:19:30,180
Are you telling me to dress like a girl?

289
00:19:30,429 --> 00:19:31,880
You won't be able to win unless you do.

290
00:19:32,044 --> 00:19:34,383
Who in their right mind would dress like a girl?!

291
00:20:02,279 --> 00:20:03,720
All right! There, this will do.

292
00:20:03,954 --> 00:20:05,400
You look super cute.

293
00:20:05,864 --> 00:20:07,640
No way, take this off me!

294
00:20:08,309 --> 00:20:10,340
Speak more like a girl!

295
00:20:10,760 --> 00:20:11,318
No!

296
00:20:11,499 --> 00:20:12,780
Unless you strip me, I don't want to!

297
00:20:14,334 --> 00:20:15,420
Everyone run!

298
00:20:15,540 --> 00:20:16,540
It's the wolf!

299
00:20:18,299 --> 00:20:21,920
Bring the wolf close and suddenly attack him!

300
00:20:33,739 --> 00:20:35,349
The medicine is taking effect.

301
00:20:35,373 --> 00:20:37,040
Ah, it hurts...

302
00:20:37,320 --> 00:20:38,060
My chest...

303
00:20:38,084 --> 00:20:40,216
Is there something wrong, my Queen?

304
00:20:40,240 --> 00:20:43,060
 Grand Duke, I have something to confess to you.

305
00:20:56,424 --> 00:20:58,080
It's Little Red Riding Hood...

306
00:20:58,964 --> 00:21:01,280
Oh my...

307
00:21:03,660 --> 00:21:04,660
Are you scared?

308
00:21:05,549 --> 00:21:07,020
Well, I'm weakened over here.

309
00:21:07,439 --> 00:21:11,540
There's nothing that tastes worse than eating a child who's trembling in fear.

310
00:21:11,914 --> 00:21:12,914
How about some flowers?

311
00:21:14,960 --> 00:21:15,960
How about some cake?

312
00:21:16,779 --> 00:21:19,440
Don't worry. I'll eat you up gently.

313
00:21:20,090 --> 00:21:21,340
Enough already!

314
00:21:21,480 --> 00:21:22,140
Stop trembling!

315
00:21:22,354 --> 00:21:23,700
Geez, what am I supposed to do?!

316
00:21:24,199 --> 00:21:26,120
If you were much smaller, I wouldn't be scared.

317
00:21:28,817 --> 00:21:29,520
How about this size?

318
00:21:29,780 --> 00:21:30,780
Even smaller?

319
00:21:31,244 --> 00:21:32,244
Guess it can't be helped.

320
00:21:33,259 --> 00:21:35,240
How's this, size?

321
00:21:36,640 --> 00:21:37,400
So cute!

322
00:21:37,585 --> 00:21:38,585
You wolf!

323
00:21:38,620 --> 00:21:39,620
Prepare yourself!

324
00:21:44,180 --> 00:21:46,480
You put up a good fight, kiddo.

325
00:21:47,350 --> 00:21:49,460
I'm gonna crush you!

326
00:21:52,004 --> 00:21:54,500
Ouch!

327
00:22:33,220 --> 00:22:34,220
Fire?!

328
00:22:34,900 --> 00:22:35,900
It is! It is!

329
00:22:38,151 --> 00:22:40,151
Help me!

330
00:22:40,816 --> 00:22:46,402
Good, good! Good, good!

331
00:22:46,426 --> 00:22:49,660
My chest hurts, it feels like something is stuck inside.

332
00:22:49,760 --> 00:22:51,926
Oh, that won't do, it's bad for your health.

333
00:22:51,951 --> 00:22:53,344
Please open up and confess.

334
00:22:53,369 --> 00:22:55,260
Spit it all out.

335
00:23:03,424 --> 00:23:05,560
Um, it's about Sapphire...

336
00:23:13,509 --> 00:23:15,172
Sapphire is actually...

337
00:23:15,196 --> 00:23:16,321
actually?

338
00:23:17,624 --> 00:23:20,034
Oh boy! I'm gonna talk, alright alright, I'm gonna talk!

339
00:23:20,059 --> 00:23:22,606
That chatter potion we got from the apothecary works really well, doesn't it?

340
00:23:22,631 --> 00:23:23,746
What do you think, Grand Duke?

341
00:23:24,020 --> 00:23:27,201
Drugging the Queen to make her spill the beans on Sapphire...

342
00:23:27,225 --> 00:23:28,951
Only a mastermind like me could pull that off—

343
00:23:28,975 --> 00:23:29,540
You idiot!

344
00:23:29,720 --> 00:23:30,180
Shut up!

345
00:23:30,340 --> 00:23:30,902
Get out of here!

346
00:23:34,429 --> 00:23:35,429
What's wrong, Lord Nylon?

347
00:23:35,500 --> 00:23:39,768
Prince, Duralumin is trying to find out from the Queen whether you're a boy or a girl!

348
00:23:39,792 --> 00:23:41,120
What did you say?!

349
00:23:42,549 --> 00:23:43,777
Opal, I'm counting on you!

350
00:23:50,119 --> 00:23:51,860
Duralumin, what are you doing to my mother?

351
00:23:52,020 --> 00:23:53,140
Nothing in particular.

352
00:23:53,280 --> 00:23:53,720
Leave!

353
00:23:54,199 --> 00:23:56,160
Sorry to have intruded, Your Majesty.

354
00:23:57,049 --> 00:24:00,240
Sapphire, you are a girl. I know that.

355
00:24:00,539 --> 00:24:03,840
But there are too many evil schemes and customs in this kingdom.

356
00:24:04,214 --> 00:24:07,560
Until that is gone, I am a boy, Mother.

357
00:24:07,999 --> 00:24:09,520
Sapphire...

358
